        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Actor" xmi:id="EAID_73B9F5E3_D336_5467_9FF4_F804BE99CD17" name="Quan tri nen tang" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_798687E1_78F8_5F8A_86B1_A0530474826E">
          <body>Nguon: BAOCAO.md muc3.1; SPEC.md muc4.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Actor" xmi:id="EAID_9F25917C_FE48_5F5A_899C_0D20FB7DACAA" name="VNPAY Sandbox" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_57EBF348_DF4C_5072_930F_972DF136B417">
          <body>Nguon: BAOCAO.md muc3.1; SPEC.md muc4.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_77EA5D89_3D79_5B3B_A036_40C424FE5361" name="Dang ky tai khoan" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_561FBC03_1D3F_5DA0_B5F7_55E72A5393F1">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.1: Cho phep khach dang ky voi userName duy nhat, email va mat khau; User mac dinh CUSTOMER, phai xac minh email truoc khi giu ve.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_539AA049_9DFC_5F37_9698_85A90D690E91" name="Xac minh email bang OTP" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_B5C1F8CE_35E0_5960_BD6B_2B53F7D63E8C">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.2: Cho phep nguoi dung xac minh dia chi email bang OTP truoc khi thuc hien thao tac giu ve.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_F8D6DD4D_1CC6_596C_BFBF_F0EDDFEC85BF" name="Tim kiem va loc su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_FB95C375_3AE6_5CD5_B082_75F1BAD65F55">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.6: Cho phep nguoi dung tra cuu danh sach su kien cong khai theo ten, danh muc, khoang ngay va thu tu mong muon.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_892424FE_2E80_53A9_A13E_0691AA22DF59" name="Chon cho va giu ve" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_9288FEBE_4411_55DB_9D36_F76DF1F2CCAE">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.8: Cho phep nguoi mua da xac minh giu toan bo ghe hoac so luong ve dung da chon trong 10 phut.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_BFF6864E_B18E_5B25_A122_38BDBAA99A7D" name="Tao don mua ve" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_59C17515_1732_53B5_8D03_B6747501B9F1">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.10: Cho phep nguoi mua tao duy nhat mot don hang tu luot giu con hieu luc.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_4A7B222D_589B_5ABC_9F4C_5414EDE2910E" name="Thanh toan qua VNPAY Sandbox" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_9EA3556F_E50F_5269_BD2B_1FD6A24B3BE9">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.12: Moi Payment thuoc dung mot Order, Order co 0..* lan thu; acceptedPayment chon CAPTURED hop le. Chi ket qua may chu/IPN da xac thuc, Hold con han va Event con ban moi phat hanh ve. PENDING/UNKNOWN khong thu lai; thu muon/trung tao Refund PAYMENT_COMPENSATION khong co Ticket. Don 0d hoan tat khong tao Payment.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_F9A8C00E_AE20_502D_860B_B281CCF19030" name="Xem don mua ve va ve dien tu" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_9CCDF93F_058F_5A2D_A0B9_F8CCFFF8C505">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.13: Cho phep nguoi mua xem cac don thuoc tai khoan minh va cac ve dien tu da duoc phat hanh.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_B44A379D_03B4_5DB4_8141_B1AF31FBAA6C" name="Gui yeu cau hoan ve va xem ket qua" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_7322123E_ED1C_5B12_B331_5B70357E4BBC">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.15: Chu don chon ve ACTIVE cung Order truoc startTime, chua co nghia vu mo; tao Refund REQUESTED/CUSTOMER_REFUND, amount = tong paidAmount va chuyen ve REFUND_PENDING. Refund giu nghia vu va lan xu ly hien hanh, khong co RefundRequest nghiep vu rieng.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_24561142_838B_5823_9769_59F5E45279E7" name="Gui yeu cau tao to chuc va xem ket qua" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_B65BA63F_E59A_5BD0_9208_241D87092FE1">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.16: Cho phep nguoi mua da xac minh de nghi tao mot to chuc va theo doi ket qua xet duyet.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_8FB4B321_DE7D_53DB_8741_F8A7DED6317A" name="Duyet hoac tu choi yeu cau tao to chuc" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_5246CE34_42E1_5F0F_83B2_2BE1AC162F1E">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.17: Quan tri duyet cung Organization tu PENDING_APPROVAL sang APPROVED, tao CommissionRule ban dau va cap MANAGER cho requester cung giao dich; tu choi giu REJECTED va ly do, duyet lap khong tao Organization thu hai.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_BE128A95_4D5A_51E1_B282_DC5A382E4AA8" name="Tao va chinh sua su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_E453F578_9AA4_5DC1_8AE8_55BE10747399">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.20: Cho phep quan ly tao ban nhap su kien va chinh sua thong tin truoc khi su kien duoc cong khai.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_B8F89393_5D12_5F99_96A7_07CE3181AFF3" name="Duyet cong khai hoac tu choi su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_2A57DB8A_E3BB_56D4_96AA_88F5F99347E6">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.24: Cho phep quan tri quyet dinh cong khai su kien hoac tu choi de to chuc chinh sua va gui lai.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_7DCE01ED_83FA_5078_AC28_260192629729" name="Quan ly ma giam gia cua to chuc" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_B9EAB748_CF10_5FC8_99B6_7B70B4C5D319">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.25: Cho phep nguoi co quyen tao va cap nhat ma giam gia thuoc mot to chuc.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_02042069_53CF_54E9_AF27_7676FE77A0A0" name="Kiem tra ve vao cua bang QR hoac ma nhap tay" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_3CAEC4BB_3ADA_58BD_8AB1_120073228299">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.26: Cho phep nhan su cua to chuc kiem tra ve tai cua bang camera hoac nhap ma thu cong theo cung mot quy trinh nghiep vu.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_0167E675_59A1_5015_97AC_8EEDFF782B8A" name="Duyet hoac tu choi yeu cau hoan ve" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_E12E0E8C_7B2D_5963_A528_1343CC24BF3B">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.28: Quan tri quyet dinh Refund REQUESTED sang APPROVED/REJECTED. Tu choi can ly do va chi khoi phuc ve neu Event chua huy; duyet chua dong nghia da hoan. Hoan 0d completeWithoutTransfer, van giu Refund, hoan tat ve/tra kho ma khong tao chuyen tien.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_7A2CC4C4_2805_5A35_8392_F8D8F5215956" name="Huy su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_6A014298_76A6_545A_A88F_0B895198FEC9">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.30: Quan tri huy Event PUBLISHED truoc startTime, dung ban/check-in, giai phong Hold va quota coupon; tiep tuc/tao Refund EVENT_CANCELLATION theo Order cho ve du dieu kien, khong trung nghia vu. Ve USED la ngoai le can quan tri xu ly, khong tu hoan.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_F388444A_D0E5_526C_9254_BB29D06910AB" name="Lap va tinh lai doi soat su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_485A68B8_4026_5899_8A62_E88D44553C8E">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.32: Quan tri lap/toi da mot Settlement moi Event, chi recalculate khi DRAFT; grossRevenue/totalRefund/totalCommission la snapshot tinh tung Order hop le, loai thu/hoan bu tru. SettlementOrderSnapshot la du lieu ky thuat theo don; Event khong co don hop le chi hien bao cao 0.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_04F49FF9_630A_5806_B00B_8789929A5EC8" name="Xem va loc bao cao" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_70F5F168_E185_5E37_B12D_1D68D6AC5319">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.35: Cho phep nguoi co quyen xem so lieu van hanh, doanh thu va kiem soat ve theo pham vi duoc cap.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_CE4FAD7E_5891_5532_B726_82947DC84F4E" name="Xem nhat ky thao tac he thong" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_8D4FB5F9_4ED3_592D_A039_9203A1B44398">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.37: Cho phep quan tri tra cuu lich su cac thao tac quan trong da duoc he thong ghi nhan.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc4, muc6.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Association" xmi:id="EAID_4600F1CE_1860_5816_A63E_A3BC630A1B2D" visibility="public">
        <memberEnd xmi:idref="EAID_D0222EC6_4E11_5745_B208_3911CA9E7FCE" />
